Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.67,Hdr,,0,0,0,,December 18, 1977 - Arima Kinen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ten Point and Tosho Boy - the two have broken clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's been a match race between these two all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Into the straight now - Ten Point takes the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grand Prix horse Tosho Boy closes in along the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:13.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Green Grass is also coming hard from behind them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:16.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Destined rivals - the final showdown of the TTG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ten Point leads - will he avenge his Classic defeats?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tosho Boy is clinging on along the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,He can't lose his last race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Green Grass out wide, looking for one late surge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:28.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two together - Ten Point just in front at the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's Ten Point! The battle of destined rivals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:40.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Seeing off the green assassin, the prince of shooting stars Ten Point wins